  "body": "* Four bedrooms, three bathrooms and a single internal-access garage\r\n* Approx. 194sqm floor area on a 188sqm section\r\n* Bold, contemporary design with a fresh and playful feel\r\n* Light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining and living spaces\r\n* Stylish kitchen with generous bench space and storage\r\n* Ground-floor bedroom with convenient access to a full bathroom\r\n* Upstairs master suite with a walk-in wardrobe\r\n* Three upstairs bedrooms offering space to rest and recharge\r\n* Contemporary bathrooms designed for everyday comfort\r\n* Private outdoor deck for relaxed afternoons and lively get-togethers\r\n* Set in the popular Millwater community, close to local schools, parks, shops and Orewa Beach\r\n\r\nSome homes are simply places to live. Others make you feel like life is just a little more exciting.\r\n\r\nWelcome to The Happy House at 9 Skulander Crescent, where bold design, inviting spaces and a playful spirit come together to create a home that is anything but ordinary. More than just a place to return to at the end of the day, this is a home designed to bring a little more joy, spontaneity and fun into everyday living.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area sets the scene for everything from slow weekend mornings to spontaneous dinners with friends. The contemporary kitchen, generous island bench and light-filled interiors create a space that feels as good for entertaining as it does for everyday living. Open the doors to the outdoor deck, and the occasion can easily spill outside.\r\n\r\nWhen the laughter settles and the evening winds down, head upstairs to your own private retreat. Three bedrooms await on the upper level, including a stylish master suite with a walk-in wardrobe. Thoughtfully appointed bathrooms add a touch of everyday indulgence, making getting ready for the day ahead feel like its own little ritual.\r\n\r\nA fourth bedroom and a full bathroom on the ground floor offer extra flexibility for guests, extended family or simply a little more room to make life your own. With four bedrooms and three bathrooms across two levels, the layout brings together personality and practicality in equal measure.\r\n\r\nAnd that's the beauty of The Happy House. It's a place to gather, to unwind, to celebrate the little things and make memories of your own. Whether you're hosting the next dinner party or enjoying a quiet moment at home, this is a space that invites you to live a little more boldly.\r\n\r\nPositioned in the heart of Millwater, you're also within easy reach of local schools, parks, Silverdale Shopping Centre, motorway connections and the beautiful Orewa Beach.\r\n\r\nDon't just be a guest in your own life. Make yourself at home, take the lead, and let the good times begin.\r\n\r\nContact Team Vinson and Amy on 022 571 7074 to arrange your private viewing or visit the next open home. For more information, visit www.vinsonamyandco.nz",
